&lt;p data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;445&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Schedule:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;217&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monday – Friday
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;217&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Three days per week: 8:00 am - 5:00 pm EST&lt;br&gt;Two days per week:11:00 AM – 8:00 PM EST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One Saturday per month 8am-5pm - When scheduled to work on a Saturday will receive a weekday off&lt;/li&gt;
