&lt;p data-start=&quot;447&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;447&quot; data-end=&quot;464&quot;&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; $28 - $35 per hour&lt;/p&gt;
