&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own how Cato’s value is positioned, launched, and activated across&amp;nbsp;EMEA. You will partner deeply with Product, Sales, Engineering, and Executive Leadership, while building and leading a world-class PMM team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
